  "about": "Chapter 5 (KB-137 B8): 20 made-up quotes that come to the deal desk, with labels. Company-level only: .example domains, no people, no contact details. Dates are days from as_of, so the rules give the same answer whenever the eval runs; the seed dates the demo quotes from the day it runs. Prices come from the price book in salesforce/quote-desk-setup.json. expected.rules is the exact set of rules the quote breaks; expected.action is what the playbook says the approver should be asked to do; expected.flags must all be present; expected.review is yes when the quote must be marked for a close look. demo marks the eight quotes the seed writes to Salesforce for the reviewed run.",
